,"rec":[["OS","Windows 10"],["Processor","Intel Core i5-2300"],["Memory","8 GB RAM"],["Graphics","GeForce GTX 650 OR Radeon HD 7750"],["DirectX","Version 11"],["Storage","2 GB available space"]],"deck":2,"blurb":"You play Rex, a veteran cop turned private detective, in this pixel-art adventure unfolding in a cyberpunk city beneath a sky-high metropolis where the neon never goes dark. You examine scenes, collect evidence and talk to the people around you while working a murder case tied to a robot uprising and to a series of killings from thirteen years earlier.\n\nThe world is dense with objects to inspect and small hidden jokes, and the tone mixes hard-boiled noir with humor, including a gang of scheming cats. It is a single-player game with a retro look, suited to players who like examining every detail of a setting and piecing a mystery together."}}